  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1724861280_2027803_49094a751ec3eddcdf9a2a8bb8302e4b.jpg",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">LET'S GET AFFILIATED!</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">We want to partner up with the best in the biz &mdash; and that means YOU!</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Calling all bloggers, content creators, customers and influencers of fashion &amp; Accessories to join our affiliate program.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p></o:p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Welcome to Justin Gregory, your premier destination for fashion accessories for every season.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">We are a NY brand bringing fabulous, unique styles to fashion breakers and makers.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Our vibe is pretty simple: we don&rsquo;t take fashion or life too seriously and we&rsquo;ve been pushing boundaries since the 90s to bring our customers all the latest looks in Accessories.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">From our fashion-forward Totes to our recently-launched one-size Vegan Leather line, we&rsquo;ve got something for everyone. Whether you are cozying up in beanies or making a statement with Runway scarves or iconic shearlings, expect many details and rich hues in every piece.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">At Justin Gregory, we believe that every accessory should be a statement piece. That's why we 'weave' care, quality and creativity into every design to create your forever accessory.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">With features in Oprah's Favorite Things, Good Morning America, and The View, our brand speaks volumes &ndash; and we want you to be a part of it. Whether you're a seasoned influencer or a rising star, there's a place for you.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Are you passionate about Fashion Accessories? Join forces with us! If you have an audience that would adore our iconic styles, become an Affiliate. We&rsquo;d be great together!</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Our program offers a 10% commission rate and a 30-day cookie duration as standard.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n</div>",
